00:06:43.860 --> 00:06:49.110
So the plugin is called Saber. So what makes Sabre so nice and easy for lightsaber effects

00:06:49.110 --> 00:06:51.260
Is that all of the settings are

00:06:51.340 --> 00:06:53.880
Automated there's only two points that you gotta animate,

00:06:53.880 --> 00:06:55.860
the base in the tip of the lightsaber

00:06:55.860 --> 00:06:59.430
And so it helps if you have like a actual lightsaber to track but on a lot of these shots

00:06:59.430 --> 00:07:01.760
